<DocsExample TExample="TooltipBasicExample" Title="Plain tooltip" Description="NTButton and NTIconButton render a plain tooltip from their Tooltip parameter. It appears on hover or keyboard focus of the button." />
<DocsExample TExample="TooltipRichExample" Title="Rich tooltip" Description="Place NTTooltip inside the element it describes, here a wrapper around the button. Variant Rich allows structured content such as a heading and supporting text." />
